DESCRIPTION:The Mule is hosting a Scholastic Book Fair from June 25–28. J
 oin us for the Kickoff event on June 25 from 2:00-8:00PM. Come out for a 
 weekend of book shopping\, local food trucks\, and live music. Profits fro
 m this four-day book fair will directly benefit the Asheville City Schools
  Foundation’s Educator Grants &amp\; Professional Development program\, 
 supporting our wonderful ACS teachers and classrooms. You can also contrib
 ute to the Share the Fair fund at the event to help purchase books for dis
 trict students in need.
LOCATION:The Mule at Devil's Foot Beverage\, 131 Sweeten Creek Rd\, Ashevil
 le\, NC 28803\, USA
SUMMARY:Scholastic Book Fair & Fundraiser
END:VEVENT
